{"matched":14,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0851a01","n":"0851a","t":"云何眼根謂以色為境淨色為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0851b01","n":"0851b","t":"諸佛出世樂演說正法樂眾僧"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0851c01","n":"0851c","t":"此遍一切善不善無記心故名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0852a01","n":"0852a","t":"者是專注義與智所依為業由"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0852b01","n":"0852b","t":"云何無癡謂癡對治如實正行"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0852c01","n":"0852c","t":"增上慢卑慢邪慢云何慢謂於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0853a01","n":"0853a","t":"云何邊執見謂薩迦耶見增上"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0853b01","n":"0853b","t":"為清淨解脫者謂即以此解脫"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0853c01","n":"0853c","t":"復由有罪不自如實發露歸懺"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0854a01","n":"0854a","t":"云何不正知謂煩惱相應慧能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0854b01","n":"0854b","t":"就自在成就現起成就如其所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0854c01","n":"0854c","t":"識此能採集諸行種子故又此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0855a01","n":"0855a","t":"復有十八界謂眼界色界眼識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1613_p0855b01","n":"0855b","t":"幾有分別謂意識界意界及法"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T31n1613-大乘廣五蘊論","source":"CBETA T31n1613 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":14,"unit":"T31 頁欄"}